  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The ETH Library promotes knowledge, supports teaching and research, and – as a trusted institution – makes the world of yesterday, today and tomorrow more comprehensible to you.\n\nFrom September 2021 to May 2022, we are conducting an image campaign. Tell us what you think of the campaign and win one of three book vouchers worth CHF 50. It will take you approximately seven minutes to complete the survey. You can take part until Sunday, 24 April 2022.\n\nGo to the survey: https://de.surveymonkey.com/r/ethlibrary?lang=en\n\n#FocusHuman – Be inspired by people and learn something new."
    }
